        "lockedProposition": "The beliefs that confer meaning, purpose, and value lie beyond the kind of proof available for shallower truths.",
        "completeLockedSourceExcerpt": "namely that we can only prove shallow truths but that the greater beliefs that give meaning purpose and value to our lives in the end lie Beyond proof and",
