        "lockedProposition": "The large number of mutually rejected gods makes the unique truth of Yahweh improbable, while skeptics merely extend believers' rejection to one additional god.",
        "completeLockedSourceExcerpt": "years of human history there's been roughly 10 000 different religions and a thousand different gods so what is the probability that Yahweh is the one true God in Amman raw Aphrodite Apollo ball Brahma Ganesha Isis mithras Osiris Shiva Thor Vishnu WOTE and Zeus and the other 986 gods are all false gods as Skeptics like to say we just go one God further you're all atheists of those Gods so we're only talking about this one",
